{"2482760":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Hunting Simulator 3","steam_appid":2482760,"required_age":"13","is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4693960,4693970,4753980],"detailed_description":"<h1>Deluxe Edition<\/h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/6ef6e7e1a4f9d63b6b5412e6770ff77a.avif?t=1793285056\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras_big\/6ef6e7e1a4f9d63b6b5412e6770ff77a.avif?t=1793285056 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.poster.avif?t=1793285056\" width=1170 height=5248 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.webm?t=1793285056\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.mp4?t=1793285056\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Enter the wilderness<br>Either on foot or behind the wheel of your all-terrain vehicle, explore this open world's stunning environments.<br><br>Set off to deepest Colorado, or untamed outback of Texas, each with dozens of wild species to hunt. In these ever-changing ecosystems, each animal reacts to what you do, ages over time, and exhibits true-to-life behaviour thanks to our unique “SimFauna” system.<br><br>Hunt your own way<br>Kit yourself out with one of the official weapons and other items , to hunt the way you want. Choose from a professional hunting arsenal, comprising rifles, shotguns, bows and crossbows. Take your pick from the best hunting brands like, Remington, Beretta, Winchester, Browning and many more.<br><br>A hunter's best friend<br>To help you in your hunt, you can rely on your faithful hunting dog. With its keen senses, it helps you better understand your surroundings and allows you to spot tracks, follow a trail, or retrieve small game.<br>Use the command wheel to make it respond to all your orders.<br><br>A warm, practical hunting lodge<br>Feel like a bit of peace and quiet, admiring your arsenal or honing your shooting skills?<br><br>Take advantage of your customisable hunting lodge to showcase your finest trophies, purchase or modify your gear, or simply relax by the fire before your next hunt.<br>Test yourself in an intense clay-pigeon shoot. Armed with your favourite weapon, knock down the targets within the allotted time to score maximum points, and try to reach the top of the leaderboard!","about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.poster.avif?t=1793285056\" width=1170 height=5248 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.webm?t=1793285056\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/extras\/322db0cd6bfc512ccc2277f78cf2e5c3.mp4?t=1793285056\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br>Enter the wilderness<br>Either on foot or behind the wheel of your all-terrain vehicle, explore this open world's stunning environments.<br><br>Set off to deepest Colorado, or untamed outback of Texas, each with dozens of wild species to hunt. In these ever-changing ecosystems, each animal reacts to what you do, ages over time, and exhibits true-to-life behaviour thanks to our unique “SimFauna” system.<br><br>Hunt your own way<br>Kit yourself out with one of the official weapons and other items , to hunt the way you want. Choose from a professional hunting arsenal, comprising rifles, shotguns, bows and crossbows. Take your pick from the best hunting brands like, Remington, Beretta, Winchester, Browning and many more.<br><br>A hunter's best friend<br>To help you in your hunt, you can rely on your faithful hunting dog. With its keen senses, it helps you better understand your surroundings and allows you to spot tracks, follow a trail, or retrieve small game.<br>Use the command wheel to make it respond to all your orders.<br><br>A warm, practical hunting lodge<br>Feel like a bit of peace and quiet, admiring your arsenal or honing your shooting skills?<br><br>Take advantage of your customisable hunting lodge to showcase your finest trophies, purchase or modify your gear, or simply relax by the fire before your next hunt.<br>Test yourself in an intense clay-pigeon shoot. Armed with your favourite weapon, knock down the targets within the allotted time to score maximum points, and try to reach the top of the leaderboard!","short_description":"This open-world game lets you experience the thrill of the hunt, with your faithful dog by your side! Choose your equipment from official brands, and explore the wilderness in search of your next game.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/1a9f19af74790e1981ddb42e627edb9c1a8a6e9f\/header_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1793285056","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/78e536b2d4459769aba45197fb53189ad042b573\/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_1.jpg?t=1793285056","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2482760\/